{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2021-10-13 06:45:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON TO HOST BUSINESS REVIEW HIGHLIGHTING PHARMACEUTICALS', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J., OCT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) WILL HOLD A BUSINESS REVIEW FOR THE INVESTMENT COMMUNITY ON THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 18, 2021, IN WHICH COMPANY LEADERS WILL SHARE A DETAILED REVIEW OF ITS PHARMACEUTICALS BUSINESS, DIFFERENTIATED STRATEGY AND ROBUST PIPELINE, AND LONG-TERM GROWTH OUTLOOK.'}